# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Stray HTML must never be public. Only index.html (the SPA shell) and
# 404.html belong in the asset root.
#
# adasda.html landed here by accident in commit fd0c979 and served a fake
# "update your Zoom client" malware lure from this site's own domain until it
# was removed. scripts/smoke-check.js now FAILS on any unexpected .html in the
# asset root, so this cannot recur silently.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
adasda.html
